 and derivatives; and other related services. In addition, it engages in funding; centralized risk management; liquid assets investments; financial instruments; and foreign currency exchange, as well as brokerage business. The company was formerly known as Thai Farmers Bank Public Company Limited and changed its name to Kasikornbank Public Company Limited in April 2003. Kasikornbank Public Company Limited was founded in 1945 and is headquartered in Bangkok, Thailand.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Kattiya  Indaravijaya", "age": 60, "title": "CEO & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1965, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 9528513, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Pipatpong  Poshyanonda", "age": 56, "title": "President", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1316293, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Chongrak  Rattanapian", "age": 56, "title": "President", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1316293, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Rungruang  Sukkirdkijpiboon", "age": 54, "title": "President", "yearBorn": 1971, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1316293, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Pipit  Aneaknithi", "age": 58, "title": "Chairman of Global Sustainability", "yearBorn": 1967, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 1316293, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Nathapol  Luepromchai", "title": "Executive Vice President", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Sansana  Sukhanunth", "age": 55, "title": "Executive VP, CFO & Chief Accounting", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Pornvipa  Tangtrongchit", "title": "Head of Investment Banking Business", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1,